{"seq":3,"slug":"disposal-local-return-route","title":"就地处置与回运的地址分流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-return-address-registry/return-route-assign/disposal-local-return-route","wordCount":2677,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"就地处置与回运的地址分流\">就地处置与回运的地址分流</h1><p>在路由选收件点之前，还有一个更靠前的决定：这件退货<strong>要不要寄</strong>。把它寄回退货中心可能花掉的运费比商品本身还贵，而退款金额并不因此减少。就地处置（在目的国直接处理，不产生回运）因此成为退货系统里一个重要的成本杠杆——但它的代价是货不再回到可控库存，且在某些国家有合规约束。</p>\n<p>这一篇讨论的是：什么时候选择不寄回，以及这个决定如何在地址维度上分流到不同的收件方。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-四条处置路径\">核心概念：四条处置路径</h2><h3 id=\"路径与收件方\">路径与收件方</h3><p>退货的处置路径不止「寄回」一条。按货物最终去向划分，有四条路径，每条对应不同的收件方地址需求。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>路径</th>\n<th>货物去向</th>\n<th>有无收件地址</th>\n<th>典型条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>回运至退货中心</td>\n<td>回到商家的海外退货中心</td>\n<td>有（收件点）</td>\n<td>商品有价值且可再售</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转本地清算</td>\n<td>卖给本地清算商/二手渠道</td>\n<td>有（清算商收件点）</td>\n<td>有残余价值但再售成本高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本地销毁</td>\n<td>合规销毁</td>\n<td>有（销毁服务商地址）</td>\n<td>低值、易腐、卫生类</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>仅退款不寄回</td>\n<td>留在买家手中</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>运费高于货值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第三条路径最容易被忽略：销毁也不是「不需要地址」——它需要一个有资质的销毁服务商的收件地址，且这个地址同样需要在地址库里管理。否则就会出现「决定销毁但无处可送」的执行断档。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分流的经济学\">分流的经济学</h3><p>分流的判据本质是一个不等式：<strong>回运的净收益是否为正</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Net</mtext><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>resale</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>return</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>reprocess</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>carry</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Net} = V_{\\text{resale}} - C_{\\text{return}} - C_{\\text{reprocess}} - C_{\\text{carry}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Net</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">resale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">return</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reprocess</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">carry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>resale</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{resale}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">resale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是商品回到可控库存后的可实现价值，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>return</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{return}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">return</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是回运运费与关税，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>reprocess</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{reprocess}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reprocess</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是质检翻新与重新上架成本，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>carry</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{carry}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">carry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是回运期间的资金占用与仓储成本。</p>\n<p>这个不等式看起来简单，但每一项的估计都有相当大的不确定性，而阈值设错的代价是不对称的：阈值偏高会把低值商品无谓地寄回，损失运费；阈值偏低会把本可再售的商品误判为低值，损失货值。因此实务上更稳健的做法是设定<strong>两条阈值构成一个决策带</strong>，落在带内的进人工或进抽样复核，而不是用一个精确的点阈值。决策带的宽度应当与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>resale</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{resale}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">resale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计置信度成反比——估计越不准，带越宽。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[退货申请] --&gt; B[估算 V_resale 与 C_return]&#10;  B --&gt; C{Net 判定}&#10;  C --&gt;|Net 明显 &gt; 0| D[回运路径]&#10;  C --&gt;|Net 明显 &lt; 0| E{商品属性}&#10;  C --&gt;|决策带内| F[抽样/人工复核]&#10;  E --&gt;|有残余价值| G[本地清算]&#10;  E --&gt;|低值/卫生类| H[本地销毁]&#10;  E --&gt;|运费高于货值| I[仅退款不寄回]&#10;  D --&gt; J[路由到退货中心收件点]&#10;  G --&gt; K[路由到清算商收件点]&#10;  H --&gt; L[路由到销毁服务商地址]&#10;  F --&gt; D&#10;  F --&gt; G\">graph TD\n  A[退货申请] --&gt; B[估算 V_resale 与 C_return]\n  B --&gt; C{Net 判定}\n  C --&gt;|Net 明显 &gt; 0| D[回运路径]\n  C --&gt;|Net 明显 &lt; 0| E{商品属性}\n  C --&gt;|决策带内| F[抽样/人工复核]\n  E --&gt;|有残余价值| G[本地清算]\n  E --&gt;|低值/卫生类| H[本地销毁]\n  E --&gt;|运费高于货值| I[仅退款不寄回]\n  D --&gt; J[路由到退货中心收件点]\n  G --&gt; K[路由到清算商收件点]\n  H --&gt; L[路由到销毁服务商地址]\n  F --&gt; D\n  F --&gt; G</pre><h2 id=\"判据的构成\">判据的构成</h2><h3 id=\"商品价值的估计\">商品价值的估计</h3><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>resale</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{resale}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">resale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不等于原售价。它应当是「回到库存后实际能以什么价格卖出」的估计，因此需要折扣掉：季节性贬值（服装尤其明显）、品类生命周期（电子产品的换代速度）、以及历史同款退货商品的再售折扣率。</p>\n<p>一个可操作的近似是用<strong>原价乘以品类-账龄折扣系数</strong>，系数由历史数据回归得到，而不是主观设定。对于没有足够历史数据的新品类，用同品类均值并在决策带的处理上更保守（更多进人工）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"回运成本的构成\">回运成本的构成</h3><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>return</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{return}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">return</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 在跨境场景下比国内退货复杂得多，因为它可能包含三部分费用与一层税务处理。</p>\n<p>费用是运费、关税与目的国的处置费。税务是「退货复进口时的关税处理」——这是一个容易被忽略的真实成本项，因为多数司法辖区对退回的出口货物设有复进口关税减免制度，但它有适用条件。以欧盟海关法为例，其「退回货物」（Returned goods）制度明确属于「进口关税减免」项下的一章，即复进口的退回货物在满足条件时可获关税减免（<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32013R0952\">欧盟海关法典 952/2013</a>）。这意味着**「符合减免条件」是成本模型里的一个假设而非默认事实**：一旦某单退货不满足条件（例如商品状态已改变、或超出制度允许的时间范围），这部分关税就必须全额计入成本。</p>\n<p>与之相对，美国的杂项退货服务（merchandise return service）只覆盖国内退货，其官方规范明确说明「外国退货不可用」（<a href=\"https://pe.usps.com/text/dmm300/505.htm\">USPS DMM 505</a>）。这说明<strong>处置路径的可用性本身是按目的国与承运商变化的</strong>，不能假设同一套路径在所有市场都成立。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"return_cost_model:&#10;  market: DE&#10;  components:&#10;    freight: { source: carrier_quote, service: returns_ground }&#10;    duty_relief_eligible: true # 复进口关税减免前提&#10;    relief_conditions:&#10;      same_state: true # 必须原状&#10;      within_period: true # 有时间限制&#10;    handling_local: 4.50 # 目的国处置费（示例量级）&#10;  reprocess:&#10;    inspection_flat: 3.20&#10;    refurbish_estimate: { source: category_history }&#10;  carry_days_estimate: 21\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">return_cost_model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  market</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">DE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  components</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    freight</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">carrier_quote</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">returns_ground</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    duty_relief_eligible</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 复进口关税减免前提</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    relief_conditions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      same_state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 必须原状</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      within_period</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 有时间限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    handling_local</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.50</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> # 目的国处置费（示例量级）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  reprocess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    inspection_flat</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3.20</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    refurbish_estimate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">source</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">category_history</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  carry_days_estimate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">21</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"原状-的判定与地址的关系\">「原状」的判定与地址的关系</h3><p>复进口关税减免要求「原状」，而「原状」的判定发生在退货中心开箱质检时——也就是说，它发生在一个本 hub 之外的环节。这构成一个跨系统的约束：<strong>地址分流不能假定复进口一定会获得减免</strong>。务实的做法是在成本模型里对关税减免做敏感性分析：如果减免成立，回运成本低于阈值；如果不成立，成本可能反超。当两种情况的结论不一致时，应当把这一单推进决策带，而不是赌减免成立。</p>\n<h2 id=\"地址维度的分流实现\">地址维度的分流实现</h2><h3 id=\"处置方式决定候选池\">处置方式决定候选池</h3><p>一旦确定了处置路径，路由的候选池就不再是「所有收件点」，而是该路径对应的收件点集合。这个映射应当在地址库中以显式的字段表达，而不是靠命名约定或运营记忆。这里的前提是收件点已经在<a href=\"../return-address-registry/overseas-return-center-address\">海外退货中心与本地退仓地址库</a>中建好了站点-地址-收件点三层结构并带有 <code>kind</code> 与能力声明——处置路径的筛选条件正是作用在这些字段上。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE disposal_route (&#10;  route_code    TEXT PRIMARY KEY,          -- reroute / liquidation / destruction / refund_only&#10;  require_address BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  point_filter  JSONB NOT NULL             -- 用于筛选候选收件点的条件&#10;);&#10;&#10;INSERT INTO disposal_route VALUES&#10;  (&#39;reroute&#39;,      true,  &#39;{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;overseas_return_center&quot;}&#39;),&#10;  (&#39;liquidation&#39;,  true,  &#39;{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;liquidation_partner&quot;}&#39;),&#10;  (&#39;destruction&#39;,  true,  &#39;{&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;destruction_vendor&quot;, &quot;licensed&quot;: true}&#39;),&#10;  (&#39;refund_only&#39;,  false, &#39;{}&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> disposal_route</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  route_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- reroute / liquidation / destruction / refund_only</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  require_address </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  point_filter  JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">             -- 用于筛选候选收件点的条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> disposal_route </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reroute'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,      true,  </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"kind\": \"overseas_return_center\"}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'liquidation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  true,  </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"kind\": \"liquidation_partner\"}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'destruction'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  true,  </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{\"kind\": \"destruction_vendor\", \"licensed\": true}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'refund_only'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  false, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'{}'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>refund_only</code> 的 <code>require_address</code> 为 false 是关键设计。这条路径不产生任何寄件动作，因此地址库、标签服务、承运商集成全部不参与——它是一个纯粹的财务动作。把它与其他三条路径并列在同一条处置链上，可以避免在代码里散落「如果不用寄就跳过地址」这类分支判断。</p>\n<h3 id=\"销毁服务商的地址同样要管\">销毁服务商的地址同样要管</h3><p>销毁路径的收件地址常常被当作一个静态常量硬编码在代码里，这是一个隐患：销毁服务商同样会换址、会在某些国家没有资质、会因为法规变化被取消许可。这些地址应当与退货收件点走同一套地址库管理流程——同样有生效窗口、同样有状态机、同样的校验链路。</p>\n<p>区别在于能力声明：销毁服务商的地址需要额外声明<strong>资质信息</strong>（许可编号、可处理的品类范围、是否接受危险品）。这部分资质信息的有效期与地址的生效窗口是两个独立的维度，不能混用——许可到期不等于地址失效，但地址可用性取决于许可是否有效。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分流决策的不可逆性\">分流决策的不可逆性</h3><p>与路由决策（选错只是更贵）不同，处置路径的决策是<strong>不可逆</strong>的：一旦商品被销毁，就无法再回运；一旦仅退款，商品就不会回到库存。因此处置决策的落库必须比路由决策更严格，需要包含决策依据的完整快照，并且对 <code>destruction</code> 与 <code>refund_only</code> 这两条不可逆路径保留人工复核的抽样。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE disposal_decision (&#10;  decision_id   TEXT PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  return_id     TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  route_code    TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES disposal_route(route_code),&#10;  est_resale    NUMERIC(12,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  est_cost      NUMERIC(12,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  net_estimate  NUMERIC(12,2) GENERATED ALWAYS AS (est_resale - est_cost) STORED,&#10;  in_decision_band BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  confidence    NUMERIC(4,3) NOT NULL,&#10;  sampled       BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  inputs_snapshot JSONB NOT NULL,&#10;  decided_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  irreversible  BOOLEAN NOT NULL&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_disposal_irrev&#10;  ON disposal_decision (decided_at)&#10;  WHERE irreversible AND sampled;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> disposal_decision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  return_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  route_code    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> disposal_route(route_code),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  est_resale    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  est_cost      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  net_estimate  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">12</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GENERATED</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ALWAYS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (est_resale </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> est_cost) STORED,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  in_decision_band </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  confidence    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sampled       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  inputs_snapshot JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decided_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  irreversible  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_disposal_irrev</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> disposal_decision (decided_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> irreversible </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sampled;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>in_decision_band</code> 与 <code>confidence</code> 两列合起来支撑抽样调度：带内且置信度低的单优先进人工，带外且置信度高的单可以直接执行。<code>inputs_snapshot</code> 保存决策时刻的全部输入，使这条决策在商品已被销毁之后仍可被完整重放与质疑。</p>\n<p>抽样比例不应当是固定值，而应当与决策的置信度挂钩：当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>resale</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{resale}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">resale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的估计依据是品类历史均值而非该 SKU 的实测数据时，抽样比例应当更高。这个动态抽样是控制不可逆决策风险的主要手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与合规的交叉\">与合规的交叉</h2><h3 id=\"危险品与受限商品\">危险品与受限商品</h3><p>部分商品在目的国的处置路径被法规限制：含独立锂电池的商品不能通过普通邮政渠道回运（IATA 的危险品规则按瓦时额定值分级，且 2025 年起对「与设备包装在一起或装在设备中」的锂电池新增了包装指令要求 PI 966-II、PI 967-I/II、PI 969-II、PI 970-I/II（<a href=\"https://www.iata.org/en/programs/cargo/dgr/lithium-batteries/\">IATA 锂电池指南</a>））；某些化学品、药品、食品在多数国家不能就地销毁而必须通过特定渠道。</p>\n<p>这些约束在地址层的表达方式是收件点的 <code>forbidden_goods_classes</code> 加处置路径的品类白名单。两者的交集决定了一件商品实际可用的路径集合——交集为空时，兜底必须落到「仅退款不寄回」或人工，而不是强行选择一个不合规的路径。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据删除的触发\">数据删除的触发</h3><p>选择「仅退款不寄回」意味着商品留在买家手中，商家侧不存在任何后续物流动作，因此退货单上与本 hub 相关的地址数据（如路由尝试产生的候选快照）应当在合理保留期后删除。GDPR 的存储限制原则要求个人数据「kept in a form which permits identification of data subjects for no longer than is necessary」（<a href=\"https://gdpr-info.eu/art-5-gdpr/\">GDPR 第 5 条</a>），而没有后续物流动作的退货单不存在保留地址数据的业务理由。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>处置路径有四条（回运、本地清算、本地销毁、仅退款不寄回），其中三条需要地址而最后一条不需要，这个区别应显式建模在处置链上。</li>\n<li>分流判据是回运净收益 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>resale</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>return</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>reprocess</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>carry</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{resale}} - C_{\\text{return}} - C_{\\text{reprocess}} - C_{\\text{carry}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">resale</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">return</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reprocess</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">carry</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，实务上用决策带而非点阈值，带内进复核。</li>\n<li>跨境回运成本必须计入复进口关税，且关税减免以「原状」为前提、有时间限制，不能假定必然成立。</li>\n<li>销毁服务商的地址与资质同样进地址库管理，但资质有效期与地址生效窗口是两个独立维度。</li>\n<li>处置决策不可逆，因此需要完整依据快照加按置信度动态调整的人工抽样；危险品与受限商品使可用路径集合变小，兜底落到仅退款或人工。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"就地处置与回运的地址分流","id":"就地处置与回运的地址分流"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：四条处置路径","id":"核心概念-四条处置路径"},{"level":3,"text":"路径与收件方","id":"路径与收件方"},{"level":3,"text":"分流的经济学","id":"分流的经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"判据的构成","id":"判据的构成"},{"level":3,"text":"商品价值的估计","id":"商品价值的估计"},{"level":3,"text":"回运成本的构成","id":"回运成本的构成"},{"level":3,"text":"「原状」的判定与地址的关系","id":"原状-的判定与地址的关系"},{"level":2,"text":"地址维度的分流实现","id":"地址维度的分流实现"},{"level":3,"text":"处置方式决定候选池","id":"处置方式决定候选池"},{"level":3,"text":"销毁服务商的地址同样要管","id":"销毁服务商的地址同样要管"},{"level":3,"text":"分流决策的不可逆性","id":"分流决策的不可逆性"},{"level":2,"text":"与合规的交叉","id":"与合规的交叉"},{"level":3,"text":"危险品与受限商品","id":"危险品与受限商品"},{"level":3,"text":"数据删除的触发","id":"数据删除的触发"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"退货标签收件地址生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-return-address-registry/return-route-assign/return-label-ship-to-gen"},"next":{"title":"退货妥投与地址准确率监控","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-return-address-registry/return-address-ops/return-address-accuracy-monitor"}}